  message: "Prospector run analysis (aggregate.json, 2026-04-11): 11 repos analyzed, 92218 candidates. Category breakdown (sorted desc): uncategorized=86731 (94%), cross_language_api=3187, handler_or_dto=1631, swagger_generated=514, memberlist_callbacks=100, goroutine_lifecycle=25, yaml_json_marshal=20, pipeline_stage_dispatch=7, cobra_cli_dispatch=3. Signals: (1) cross_language_api=3187 confirms WI-tinip (HTTP linker) as the highest-leverage next investment; (2) 94% uncategorized rate blocks signal extraction beyond the recognized 6% — filed WI-vupin to improve the categorization ruleset; (3) 3 repos failed (trino/envoy/vscode, 161–209 MB, largest in cohort) — filed WI-hagip to profile and fix the memory/time regression on large repos. Status field locked; leaving as-is. Deliverable (artifact + analysis) delivered."  # 6b5b
