  message: "Why this item is still open (clarification from 2026-04-16): the artifact at ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/prospector_runs/run-2026-04-11-full/ exists, but artifact-on-disk is NOT sufficient for completion. The real goal is actionable signal for prioritizing linker investment, and today 94% of the 92218 candidates are bucket-uncategorized — rank-by-frequency is noisy at that rate. Concrete bar for done: re-run the prospector after WI-vupin lands an improved categorizer and achieve <50% uncategorized. WI-vupin is marked isbefore WI-tubot to enforce the dependency structurally. The status field is locked to prevent superficial closure on proxy evidence (JSON file present ≠ signal useful). Do NOT mark done until (1) WI-vupin ships, (2) a re-run meets the <50% threshold, (3) the aggregate signal is reviewed for whether it actually steers linker work."  # 1cfc
